<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατολμάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>behave boldly towards</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.103.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>make an insolent attack upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.8.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῆς κοινῆς πίστεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πρῶτος -ήσας θαλάττης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωμένης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοτρίων ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.3c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῦ καλῶς ἔχοντος</span>
			<i>presume beyond</i> propriety, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				39.1.9
			</span></i>: also c. gen., <i>make a bold bid for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τῶν ὅλων ἀρχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.25.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> strengthd.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμάω</span>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.47.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				42.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατετολμηκότες</span>
			<i>desperate, reckless persons</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sto.Herc.</u>
				339.12
			</span></i>: c.inf., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.13.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				3.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.644
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἔφοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
